lementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-532def7\" data-id=\"532def7\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-336776e elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"336776e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Notre culture<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ce0b1ed elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ce0b1ed\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Contribution de Breedj<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fb4a0b4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fb4a0b4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Nous sommes d\u00e9termin\u00e9s \u00e0 cr\u00e9er un avenir durable et inclusif pour tous. Actuellement, notre Breedj soutient directement au moins quatre objectifs de d\u00e9veloppement des Nations unies.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-0fcd547 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"0fcd547\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" id=\"egalite-des-genres\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-341b0a2\" data-id=\"341b0a2\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fe89f5e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"fe89f5e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1500\" src=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Fostering-gender-equality.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-5545\" alt=\"Fostering gender equality\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Fostering-gender-equality.png 1500w, https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Fostering-gender-equality-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Fostering-gender-equality-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Fostering-gender-equality-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Fostering-gender-equality-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-fdf08d5\" data-id=\"fdf08d5\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ac61801 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ac61801\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Promouvoir l'\u00e9galit\u00e9 des genres<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fcc9ec5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fcc9ec5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>L&#8217;\u00e9galit\u00e9 entre les hommes et les femmes n&#8217;est pas seulement un droit humain fondamental, c&#8217;est aussi un fondement n\u00e9cessaire pour un monde pacifique, prosp\u00e8re et durable. L&#8217;ODD vise \u00e0 mettre fin \u00e0 toutes les formes de discrimination, de violence et de pratiques n\u00e9fastes \u00e0 l&#8217;encontre des femmes et des filles partout dans le monde. Il met l&#8217;accent sur l&#8217;\u00e9galit\u00e9 des chances en mati\u00e8re de leadership, d&#8217;\u00e9ducation et de travail.<\/p>\n<p>Breedj promeut l&#8217;\u00e9galit\u00e9 des sexes en veillant \u00e0 ce que les processus d&#8217;embauche soient exempts de pr\u00e9jug\u00e9s. En fournissant une plateforme qui permet aux entreprises de trouver, d&#8217;embaucher et d&#8217;int\u00e9grer des talents de diff\u00e9rents pays, Breedj ouvre des portes aux femmes professionnelles de toute l&#8217;Afrique. Cela permet de garantir l&#8217;\u00e9galit\u00e9 des chances en mati\u00e8re d&#8217;emploi, de promouvoir une main-d&#8217;\u0153uvre \u00e9quilibr\u00e9e entre les hommes et les femmes et de soutenir l&#8217;effort mondial en faveur de la parit\u00e9 entre les hommes et les femmes.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-288ddc3 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"288ddc3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-dc0d472 elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"dc0d472\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" id=\"travail-decent\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-9b051dc\" data-id=\"9b051dc\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-37d2a38 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"37d2a38\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Favoriser un travail d\u00e9cent<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d3d6662 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d3d6662\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>L&#8217;objectif est de promouvoir une croissance \u00e9conomique soutenue, inclusive et durable, le plein emploi productif et un travail d\u00e9cent pour tous. Cet objectif reconna\u00eet que la croissance \u00e9conomique doit \u00eatre inclusive et profiter \u00e0 tous les membres de la soci\u00e9t\u00e9.<\/p>\n<p>Les principaux services de Breedj, tels que Global EOR et Global RPO, cr\u00e9ent davantage d&#8217;opportunit\u00e9s d&#8217;emploi et promeuvent des conditions de travail d\u00e9centes. Elle garantit le respect des droits des travailleurs et permet aux talents africains d&#8217;acc\u00e9der aux march\u00e9s mondiaux de l&#8217;emploi, de b\u00e9n\u00e9ficier de conditions de travail d\u00e9centes et de faire partie d&#8217;une \u00e9conomie mondiale en pleine croissance.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-a9f3b51\" data-id=\"a9f3b51\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f468c9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"5f468c9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Promoting-decent-work-1024x1024.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5546\" alt=\"Promoting decent work\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Promoting-decent-work-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Promoting-decent-work-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Promoting-decent-work-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Promoting-decent-work-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Promoting-decent-work.png 1500w\" sizes=\